{"code":"pl-PL","name":"Polish","native":"Polski","badge":"PL","tts":"pl-PL","sheets":[{"id":"C1","mode":"utility","kind":"core","title":"Keep it alive","blurb":"The lines that rescue any conversation. You’ll use these every day, everywhere.","items":[{"id":"c1.1","t":"Nie rozumiem.","say":"nyeh roh-ZOO-myem","en":"I don't understand.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"]},{"id":"c1.2","t":"Nie wiem.","say":"nyeh VYEM","en":"I don't know.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"]},{"id":"c1.3","t":"Chwileczkę, proszę.","say":"khvee-LECH-keh, PROH-sheh","en":"One moment, please.","ctx":["work","shops","phone"],"tags":"wait hold on sec moment"},{"id":"c1.4","t":"Może pan powtórzyć?","say":"MOH-zheh pahn pof-TOO-zhich","en":"Could you repeat that? (to a man; to a woman: pani)","ctx":["work","travel","chat"],"tags":"repeat again pardon what"},{"id":"c1.5","t":"Wolniej, proszę.","say":"VOL-nyey, PROH-sheh","en":"Slower, please.","ctx":["travel","chat"],"tags":"slow slowly speak"},{"id":"c1.6","t":"Jak się mówi „…”?","say":"yak sheh MOO-vee","en":"How do you say “…”?","ctx":["everywhere"],"tags":"word translate"}]},{"id":"C2","mode":"utility","kind":"core","title":"React like you belong","blurb":"Short reactions that make you sound fluent while you listen.","items":[{"id":"c2.1","t":"Jasne.","say":"YAHS-neh","en":"Sure. / Of course.","ctx":["work","shops","chat"],"tags":"yes ok okay sure course"},{"id":"c2.2","t":"Dokładnie.","say":"dok-WAHD-nyeh","en":"Exactly. / Right.","ctx":["work","chat"],"tags":"yes right correct agree"},{"id":"c2.3","t":"Chyba tak.","say":"KHI-bah tahk","en":"I think so.","ctx":["work","chat"]},{"id":"c2.4","t":"Naprawdę?","say":"nah-PRAHV-deh","en":"Really?","ctx":["chat"]},{"id":"c2.5","t":"Nie ma problemu.","say":"nyeh mah proh-BLEH-moo","en":"No problem. / No worries.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"],"tags":"welcome fine ok"},{"id":"c2.6","t":"Super!","say":"SOO-per","en":"Great! / How nice!","ctx":["chat","family"],"tags":"cool awesome nice"}]},{"id":"C3","mode":"utility","kind":"core","title":"Frames","blurb":"Phrases with a blank. Drop in any word you know and you have a new sentence.","items":[{"id":"c3.1","t":"Gdzie jest {x}?","say":"gjeh yest {x}","en":"Where is {x}?","ctx":["travel","toilets"],"tags":"where find","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"bathroom","fits":["place","work"]},{"id":"c3.2","t":"Poproszę {x:acc}.","say":"poh-PROH-sheh {x:acc}","en":"I'd like {x}.","ctx":["food","shops"],"tags":"want like would order get","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"coffee","fits":["thing"]},{"id":"c3.3","t":"Czy jest {x}?","say":"chi yest {x}","en":"Is there {x}?","ctx":["shops","food"],"tags":"have any got there","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"water","fits":["thing"]},{"id":"c3.4","t":"{x:acc}, proszę.","say":"{x:acc}, PROH-sheh","en":"{x}, please.","ctx":["everywhere"],"tags":"please give","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"bill","fits":["thing","work"]},{"id":"c3.5","t":"Muszę {x}.","say":"MOO-sheh {x}","en":"I have to {x}.","ctx":["work","plans"],"tags":"must need got","frame":true,"takes":"verb","ex":"leave"},{"id":"c3.6","t":"Czy mogę {x}?","say":"chi MOH-geh {x}","en":"Can I {x}?","ctx":["work","travel"],"tags":"can may could allowed","frame":true,"takes":"verb","ex":"comein"}]},{"id":"W","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"work","title":"Work: Slack & meetings","blurb":"Mostly lines you already know, plus two new ones and some words for your blanks.","items":[{"id":"w.1","t":"Sprawdzę to.","say":"SPRAHV-dzeh toh","en":"I'll check it.","tags":"look into get back"},{"id":"w.2","t":"Mam spotkanie.","say":"mahm spot-KAH-nyeh","en":"I have a meeting.","tags":"busy call"}],"core":["c1.3","c1.1","c1.2","c1.4","c2.1","c2.2"],"words":["meeting","file","screen","message","tomorrow"]},{"id":"T1","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Eating out","blurb":"Your frames do most of the ordering. A few new lines and some food words.","diet":true,"items":[{"id":"t1.1","t":"Czy to jest ostre?","say":"chi toh yest OS-treh","en":"Is it spicy?","tags":"hot chili"},{"id":"t1.2","t":"Bez cebuli, proszę.","say":"bez tseh-BOO-lee, PROH-sheh","en":"Without onion, please."},{"id":"t1.3","t":"Co pan poleca?","say":"tsoh pahn poh-LEH-tsah","en":"What do you recommend? (to a woman: pani)"},{"id":"t1.4","t":"Nie jem mięsa.","say":"nyeh yem MYEN-sah","en":"I don't eat meat.","tags":"vegetarian vegan meat"}],"core":["c3.2","c3.4","c3.3","c1.1"],"words":["water","coffee","bill","menu","beer","this"]},{"id":"T2","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Shopping & money","blurb":"Want, have, one moment: all core. Four new lines.","items":[{"id":"t2.1","t":"Ile to kosztuje?","say":"EE-leh toh kosh-TOO-yeh","en":"How much is it?","tags":"price cost how much"},{"id":"t2.2","t":"Tylko się rozglądam.","say":"TIL-koh sheh roz-GLON-dahm","en":"I'm just looking."},{"id":"t2.3","t":"Wezmę to.","say":"VEZ-meh toh","en":"I'll take it."},{"id":"t2.4","t":"Czy mogę zapłacić kartą?","say":"chi MOH-geh zah-PWAH-cheech KAR-tow","en":"Can I pay by card?","tags":"credit card cash pay"}],"core":["c3.2","c3.3","c1.3"],"words":["this","bag"]},{"id":"T3","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Getting around","blurb":"Ask with your core frame, then understand the answer.","items":[{"id":"t3.1","t":"Czy to daleko?","say":"chi toh dah-LEH-koh","en":"Is it far?"},{"id":"t3.2","t":"Na lotnisko, proszę.","say":"nah lot-NEES-koh, PROH-sheh","en":"To the airport, please. (taxi)","tags":"taxi cab driver"},{"id":"t3.3","t":"w lewo · w prawo · prosto","say":"v LEH-voh · f PRAH-voh · PROS-toh","en":"left · right · straight on","hear":true,"tags":"directions"}],"core":["c3.1","c1.5","c1.4"],"words":["station","airport","hotel"]},{"id":"T4","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Toilets, help & signs","blurb":"Ask with your core frame. New: a few emergency lines and the signs you’ll see.","signs":true,"items":[{"id":"t4.1","t":"Pomocy!","say":"poh-MOH-tsi","en":"Help!","tags":"emergency"},{"id":"t4.2","t":"Nie ma papieru toaletowego.","say":"nyeh mah pah-PYEH-roo toh-ah-leh-toh-VEH-goh","en":"There's no toilet paper."},{"id":"t4.3","t":"Źle się czuję.","say":"zhleh sheh CHOO-yeh","en":"I feel sick.","tags":"ill unwell doctor"},{"id":"t4.4","t":"Proszę wezwać karetkę.","say":"PROH-sheh VEZ-vahch kah-RET-keh","en":"Please call an ambulance.","tags":"emergency doctor"}],"core":["c3.1","c3.4","c1.1"],"words":["bathroom","pharmacy","hospital"]},{"id":"F","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"family","title":"Family & small talk","blurb":"Reactions carry the conversation. Four new lines to start one.","items":[{"id":"f.1","t":"Miło mi.","say":"MEE-woh mee","en":"Nice to meet you."},{"id":"f.2","t":"Skąd jesteś?","say":"skont YES-tesh","en":"Where are you from?"},{"id":"f.3","t":"Czym się zajmujesz?","say":"chim sheh zay-MOO-yesh","en":"What do you do (for work)?"},{"id":"f.4","t":"Pyszne!","say":"PISH-neh","en":"It's delicious!"}],"core":["c2.1","c2.4","c2.6","c2.3"]},{"id":"B1","mode":"basic","kind":"basic","title":"Hello & basics","blurb":"Greetings, yes and no, please and thanks.","items":[{"id":"b1.1","t":"Cześć.","say":"cheshch","en":"Hi. (casual)","tags":"hi hey"},{"id":"b1.2","t":"Dzień dobry.","say":"jeyn DOB-ri","en":"Hello. / Good morning. (polite)"},{"id":"b1.3","t":"Jak się masz?","say":"yak sheh mahsh","en":"How are you?"},{"id":"b1.4","t":"Tak. · Nie.","say":"tahk · nyeh","en":"Yes. · No."},{"id":"b1.5","t":"Proszę.","say":"PROH-sheh","en":"Please."},{"id":"b1.6","t":"Dziękuję.","say":"jen-KOO-yeh","en":"Thank you."},{"id":"b1.7","t":"Przepraszam.","say":"psheh-PRAH-shahm","en":"Sorry. / Excuse me.","tags":"excuse me pardon apologize"},{"id":"b1.8","t":"Do widzenia.","say":"doh vee-DZEH-nyah","en":"Goodbye.","tags":"bye"}]},{"id":"B2","mode":"basic","kind":"basic","title":"Numbers","blurb":"Enough for prices, times and phone numbers.","items":[{"id":"b2.1","t":"jeden · dwa · trzy","say":"YEH-den · dvah · tshi","en":"1 · 2 · 3"},{"id":"b2.2","t":"cztery · pięć · sześć","say":"CHTEH-ri · pyench · sheshch","en":"4 · 5 · 6"},{"id":"b2.3","t":"siedem · osiem · dziewięć","say":"SHEH-dem · OH-shem · JEH-vyench","en":"7 · 8 · 9"},{"id":"b2.4","t":"dziesięć · dwadzieścia · sto","say":"JEH-shench · dvah-JESH-chah · stoh","en":"10 · 20 · 100"}]},{"id":"B3","mode":"basic","kind":"blueprint","title":"Blueprint","blurb":"How the language works, on one page. Spot the pattern; skip the rulebook.","items":[{"id":"b3.1","t":"Jabłko jest czerwone.","say":"YAHP-koh yest cher-VOH-neh","en":"The apple is red.","note":"no “a / the” · the adjective agrees with the noun"},{"id":"b3.2","t":"Jem jabłko.","say":"yem YAHP-koh","en":"I eat the apple.","note":"-m = I, so no “ja” needed"},{"id":"b3.3","t":"Zjadłem jabłko.","say":"ZYAHD-wem YAHP-koh","en":"I ate the apple.","note":"past: -łem (man) / -łam (woman)"},{"id":"b3.4","t":"Chcę zjeść jabłko.","say":"khtseh zyeshch YAHP-koh","en":"I want to eat the apple.","note":"helper + infinitive"},{"id":"b3.5","t":"Czy jesz jabłka?","say":"chi yesh YAHP-kah","en":"Do you eat apples?","note":"czy at the start asks yes/no"}]}],"words":[{"id":"bathroom","t":"toaleta","say":"toh-ah-LEH-tah","en":"the bathroom","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"toilet restroom washroom wc loo"},{"id":"pharmacy","t":"apteka","say":"ahp-TEH-kah","en":"the pharmacy","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"drugstore chemist medicine"},{"id":"hospital","t":"szpital","say":"SHPEE-tahl","en":"the hospital","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"doctor emergency"},{"id":"station","t":"dworzec","say":"DVOH-zhets","en":"the station","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"train metro subway"},{"id":"airport","t":"lotnisko","say":"lot-NEES-koh","en":"the airport","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"flight plane"},{"id":"hotel","t":"hotel","say":"HOH-tel","en":"the hotel","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"room stay"},{"id":"water","t":"woda","say":"VOH-dah","en":"water","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"drink","acc":"wodę","accSay":"VOH-deh"},{"id":"coffee","t":"kawa","say":"KAH-vah","en":"a coffee","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"cafe drink","acc":"kawę","accSay":"KAH-veh"},{"id":"bill","t":"rachunek","say":"rah-KHOO-nek","en":"the bill","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"check pay receipt"},{"id":"menu","t":"menu","say":"MEH-noo","en":"the menu","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"food order"},{"id":"beer","t":"piwo","say":"PEE-voh","en":"a beer","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"drink alcohol"},{"id":"this","t":"to","say":"toh","en":"this one","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"that one"},{"id":"bag","t":"torebka","say":"toh-REP-kah","en":"a bag","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"plastic bag","acc":"torebkę","accSay":"toh-REP-keh"},{"id":"meeting","t":"spotkanie","say":"spot-KAH-nyeh","en":"the meeting","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"call standup zoom"},{"id":"file","t":"plik","say":"pleek","en":"the file","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"document doc"},{"id":"screen","t":"ekran","say":"EK-rahn","en":"the screen","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"share screen"},{"id":"message","t":"wiadomość","say":"vyah-DOH-moshch","en":"the message","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"slack text dm"},{"id":"tomorrow","t":"jutro","say":"YOO-troh","en":"tomorrow","kind":"time"},{"id":"leave","t":"iść","say":"eeshch","en":"go","kind":"verb","tags":"leave go"},{"id":"comein","t":"wejść","say":"veyshch","en":"come in","kind":"verb","tags":"enter"},{"id":"pay","t":"zapłacić","say":"zah-PWAH-cheech","en":"pay","kind":"verb","tags":"card cash"}],"diet":{"title":"Alergia · proszę przeczytać","ask":"Czy to danie zawiera któryś z tych składników?","askEn":"Does this dish contain any of these?","thanks":"Bardzo dziękuję!","note":"","options":{"peanut":{"label":"Peanut allergy","t":"Mam ciężką alergię na orzeszki ziemne. Nie mogę jeść orzeszków ziemnych ani oleju arachidowego.","en":"I have a severe peanut allergy. I can't eat peanuts or peanut oil."},"shellfish":{"label":"Shellfish allergy","t":"Mam ciężką alergię na owoce morza (krewetki, kraby, małże).","en":"I have a severe shellfish allergy (shrimp, crab, shellfish)."},"gluten":{"label":"No gluten","t":"Nie mogę jeść glutenu (pszenica, jęczmień, żyto).","en":"I can't eat gluten (wheat)."},"vegetarian":{"label":"No meat or fish","t":"Nie jem mięsa, kurczaka ani ryb.","en":"I don't eat meat, chicken or fish."},"pork":{"label":"No pork","t":"Nie jem wieprzowiny.","en":"I don't eat pork."}}},"signs":[{"t":"TOALETA · WC","en":"Restrooms"},{"t":"○ · ▽","en":"Circle = women, triangle = men","warn":true},{"t":"WYJŚCIE · WEJŚCIE","en":"Exit · Entrance"},{"t":"PCHAĆ · CIĄGNĄĆ","en":"Push · Pull"},{"t":"WYJŚCIE EWAKUACYJNE","en":"Emergency exit"}]}